## Mocking Pattern
Use interfaces for all external dependencies so they can be mocked in tests.

```go
// Define interface
type AnthropicClient interface {
    Complete(ctx context.Context, prompt string) (string, error)
}

// Mock for tests
type MockAnthropicClient struct {
    Response string
    Err      error
}

func (m *MockAnthropicClient) Complete(ctx context.Context, prompt string) (string, error) {
    return m.Response, m.Err
}
```

## Test Helpers
Create test fixtures in a testdata/ folder per package.
Create helper functions to build test markets.

```go
func testMarket(venue, title string, yesPrice float64) models.Market {
    return models.Market{
        ID:        "test-id",
        Venue:     venue,
        Title:     title,
        YesBid:    yesPrice - 0.01,
        YesAsk:    yesPrice + 0.01,
        YesMid:    yesPrice,
        NoPrice:   1.0 - yesPrice,
        Spread:    0.02,
        Liquidity: 100000,
        Volume24h: 50000,
        ResolvesAt: time.Now().Add(30 * 24 * time.Hour),
        FetchedAt:  time.Now(),
        Status:    "open",
    }
}
```

